T*
(ACME PETROCHEMICAL DEMO COMPLEX - UNIT 2300) Tj
T*
(PROCESS FLOW DIAGRAM \(PFD\): DECOMPOSER REACTOR & NEUTRALIZATION SECTION) Tj
T*
(Drawing Number: PFD-23-0005 | Revision: Z1 | Process Unit: Unit 2300) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. PROCESS TOPOLOGY & REACTION LOOP) Tj
T*
(- Concentrated 82 wt% CHP feed \(Stream S229 from V-2301 / P-2301A/B\) and dilute sulfuric acid catalyst \(Stream S310\) enter Decomposer Reactor D-2304 operating at 82.0 degC and 1.8 kg/cm2g.) Tj
T*
(- High-rate circulation loop \(Stream S379, 185,000 kg/hr, 12.7:1 recycle ratio\) circulates reaction mixture from D-2304 through Reactor Circulation Cooler E-2307 \(duty 4.85 Gcal/hr\) and returns cooled Stream S380 at 74.0 degC to D-2304.) Tj
T*
(- Cleaved Phenol + Acetone reaction product \(Stream S384, 14,500 kg/hr\) exits D-2304 via Level Control Valve LV-1301 to Neutralization Drum D-2310, where aqueous Sodium Phenate neutralizes residual sulfuric acid catalyst.) Tj
T*
(- Emergency Quench Header \(Stream S387\) supplies chilled Cumene through SIL-2 Valve XV-1309 directly into D-2304 upon Interlock I-2304 activation.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
